  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 44 plugins, with the official repo gaining 776 stars and npm weekly downloads at 353,089; desktop clients led growth as dataelement/dsh-desktop and anywhere-labs/dsh-desktop each added 193 and 192 stars, alongside the dsh 0.1.6-alpha.2 release. However, 14,726 of 15,665 non-fork plugins saw no update within a day, leaving the health score at 38, so activity—not raw totals—warrants continued observation.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>44</b> 个插件，官方仓库涨 <b>776</b> 星、npm 周下载 <b>353089</b>；桌面端仍是热度中心，dataelement/dsh-desktop 与 anywhere-labs/dsh-desktop 各涨 <b>193</b>、<b>192</b> 星，官方发布 dsh <b>0.1.6-alpha.2</b>。不过 <b>15665</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>14726</b> 个一天内无更新，健康分仅 <b>38</b>，建议持续观察活跃度而非只看总量。"
  }
